{
    "test_name": "MOB.123_Map_Switch_Map",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.123_Map_Switch_Map",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.123` **The map's `Switch Map` picker** \u2014 checklist \ud83d\udfe2 #12.\n- **Switches and switches back.** `onSelect` only writes `mobile-map-id` to\n  sessionStorage \u2014 no mutation \u2014 so the test proves a real switch, not just that a modal\n  opened: OPEN (holds the stored map, \u2265 2 options, one checked) \u2192 DISMISS (no write) \u2192\n  SWITCH (the picked id is stored) \u2192 READBACK (reopened, the new map is checked) \u2192\n  RESTORE (`always`).\n- **The pick closes the picker** because `<MapGl key={mapId}>` remounts the whole control\n  stack. Pinned: a picker left open on a stale map would be the regression.\n- **Premise:** the button is disabled below 2 maps. Dev has 3 (read over the API, 0 runs),\n  so this is the enabled side; the disabled side needs someone's maps deleted and is not\n  asserted.\n- \ud83d\uded1 **No map name or id is hardcoded** (trap 29): options are matched by their `value`\n  attribute against ids read from sessionStorage at run time, carried between steps on\n  `window` (the page never navigates).",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Map",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
                "count": 1,
                "interval": 300.0
            },
            "rum_settings": {
                "is_enabled": false
            },
            "tick_every": 86400
        },
        "steps": [
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Navigate to the mobile map",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/map"
                },
                "type": "goToUrl"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let the map begin initialising",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 5
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Test the \"Map\" page rendered",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "check": "contains",
                    "value": "Map",
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/map",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//*[@id=\"page-title\"]//h4[contains(normalize-space(.), \"Map\")]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementContent",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "The Mapbox WebGL canvas rendered",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/map",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//canvas[contains(@class,\"mapboxgl-canvas\")]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementPresent",
                "timeout": 60
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "CAPTURE: `mobile-map-id` holds the map on screen (written on mount from the user's default map)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "let stored = null;\ntry { stored = JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem('mobile-map-id') || 'null'); }\ncatch (e) { return false; }\nif (typeof stored !== 'string' || !stored) return false;\nwindow.__ddMapBefore = stored;\nreturn true;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "OPEN: the `Switch Map` control is ENABLED \u2014 the org has \u2265 2 maps",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "const b = document.querySelector('button[aria-label=\"Switch Map\"]');\nreturn !!b && !b.disabled;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 60
